---
title: "RogueLike Valkur — Sequence: LLM-Powered NPC Chat"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant P   as Player
    participant IS  as InputSystem
    participant CR  as ChatRouterSystem
    participant CP  as ChatProximitySystem
    participant GPN as Gpt5NanoProvider
    participant OA  as OpenAI Responses API
    participant CBR as ChatBubbleRenderSystem

    P->>IS: Press T  (open chat input)
    IS->>CR: enqueue ChatInputEvent(text, player_entity)

    CR->>CP: query NPCs within chat_range
    CP-->>CR: nearest NPC entity_id

    CR->>GPN: provider.generate(messages)
    Note over GPN: Loads OPENAI_API_KEY<br/>from env or .env file<br/>Builds _ProviderConfig from<br/>data/config/chat.json

    GPN->>OA: POST /v1/responses<br/>{model, input, reasoning:{effort:low}, tools?}
    Note over OA: timeout: 20 s<br/>No streaming<br/>tool_choice: auto

    OA-->>GPN: HTTP 200  {output_text, tool_calls?, usage}
    Note over GPN: Parses output_text<br/>Extracts tool_calls if present<br/>Sanitises function names (regex)

    GPN-->>CR: LLMResult(text, tool_calls, usage)

    alt tool_call present  (e.g. vendor.buy)
        CR->>CR: dispatch tool action to VendorTradeSystem
    end

    CR->>CP: attach NPC response text to entity
    CP->>CBR: schedule ChatBubble component on NPC entity

    CBR-->>P: Speech bubble rendered above NPC (next frame)
